OL,3,GNEWSATribunal finds ex-chief constable
OL,4,Alied over workplace affairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former chief constable lied about
OL,7,Fextra-marital affairs with two junior
OL,8,Fofficers and tried to "bully" one of
OL,9,Fthe women to keep quiet, a police
OL,10,Fstandards tribunal has found.
OL,12,FScott Chilton, 53, had sex with one
OL,13,Fwoman while on duty, later denied the
OL,14,Frelationship and tried to prevent an
OL,15,Finvestigation into it, the panel
OL,16,Fconcluded.
OL,18,FHe also abused his position as chief
OL,19,Fconstable to have sex with a second
OL,20,Fwoman and "bombarded" her with messages
OL,21,Fto say nothing, it said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
